  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 55.20 minus 0.16 x\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>55.20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.16</mn><mi>x</mi></math> gives the estimated surface water temperature <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, in degrees Celsius, of a body of water on the <math alttext=\"xth\"><mi>x</mi>\n<mtext>th</mtext></math> day of the year, where <math alttext=\"220 less than or equals x less than or equals 360\"><mn>220</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>360</mn></math>. Based on the model, what is the estimated surface water temperature, in degrees Celsius, of this body of water on the&nbsp;<math alttext=\"326th\"><mn>326</mn><mtext>th</mtext></math> day of the year?</p>",
